"With f = sin x, f′ = cos x: cos x·sinⁿx = f′·fⁿ → fⁿ⁺¹/(n+1)." = "עם f = sin x, f′ = cos x: cos x·sinⁿx = f′·fⁿ → fⁿ⁺¹/(n+1).";
"With f = x² + a, f′ = 2x, so x·√f = ½·f′·f^(1/2)." = "עם f = x² + a, f′ = 2x, לכן x·√f = ½·f′·f^(1/2).";
"With t = eˣ: f = 2t²/(t² − 5t + 4) and f′(x) = t·df/dt = 2t²(8 − 5t)/(t² − 5t + 4)². The denominator (eˣ − 1)(eˣ − 4) is 0 at x = 0 and x = ln 4: the asymptotes." = "עם t = eˣ: f = 2t²/(t² − 5t + 4) ו-f′(x) = t·df/dt = 2t²(8 − 5t)/(t² − 5t + 4)². המכנה (eˣ − 1)(eˣ − 4) מתאפס ב-x = 0 וב-x = ln 4: האסימפטוטות.";
"With u = ln x: f = u²/(u² − 1) = 1 + 1/(u² − 1), so f′(x) = −2u/(u² − 1)² · (1/x) = −2 ln x/(x((ln x)² − 1)²). The asymptotes are where (ln x)² = 1: x = e and x = 1/e." = "עם u = ln x: f = u²/(u² − 1) = 1 + 1/(u² − 1), לכן f′(x) = −2u/(u² − 1)² · (1/x) = −2 ln x/(x((ln x)² − 1)²). האסימפטוטות איפה ש-(ln x)² = 1: x = e ו-x = 1/e.";
